{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/7489","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"TR650 .D677","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"7489","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Of night and day  ","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Dorr, Nell.","id":"actor/dorr-nell","type":"Actor"},{"_label":"New York Graphic Society","id":"actor/new-york-graphic-society","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"1968","begin_of_the_begin":"1968-01-01T00:00:00Z","end_of_the_end":"1968-01-01T00:00:00Z","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"grl copy : fine condition ; dust jacket : good condition.|Inscription on p. [7] from Nell Dorr to Georgia O'Keeffe : To Georgia O'Keeffe - / Bennie De [doabche?] asked me to send / this to you. It brings you his greetings. / It brings from me pure inspiration - / nothing less. (unless it is the [paccion munnis / of taens?] with Stieglitz and a basket of / Christmas cookies I once sent you). / 'Of Night and Day' - of what else is there? / Nell Dorr. / July 3 - 1969.|Signature on dust jacket by Nell Dorr.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"From Georgia O'Keeffe's Ghost Ranch library.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}